WEBVTT

00:09:58.135 --> 00:10:02.723
give me the strength to move beyond
HIV stigma and HIV shame.

00:10:02.765 --> 00:10:04.850
And trust me, all of you,
please trust me --

00:10:04.892 --> 00:10:07.519
if I can do it, then anyone can do it.

00:10:07.561 --> 00:10:09.396
And then, and only then,

00:10:09.438 --> 00:10:12.608
do we have a real chance
of ending HIV forever.

00:10:13.150 --> 00:10:14.610
So please,

00:10:14.652 --> 00:10:16.945
please, please help me,

00:10:16.945 --> 00:10:19.698
because together, we can tackle stigma.

00:10:19.698 --> 00:10:21.325
Thank you so much.

00:10:21.367 --> 00:10:26.747
(Cheers and applause)